[l_english.STATE_LORE_827]
Before the era of Twilight Sparkle, the evil Lord of Chaos had never had friends in history, but there were a few names that he cherished, with relationships deeper than friendship. One of them lived in ancient Anugypt — the protector of the pharaohs and all creatures, the revolutionary of Anugypt, the companion of chaos, the pioneer of republic, Baast.
Baast grew up in a dark age under the long rule of a tyrant. Under the Anugypt Empire, all races except for the jackals were asked to sacrifice for the black magic rituals. The cats race suffered the most oppression. They had to offer food to the desert god of death to sustain the jackal nobles, provide gold to forge an immense golden bone, and give blood to awaken the sleeping undead. They even had to supply the pigments for the jackals’ delusional art, and the bricks and labor to build their vain pyramids.
Baast joined the underground resistance early on, leading the cats in the fight against the evil King of Anugypt. Through countless battles, Baast grew into a true leader, and she also met a draconequus who was passing through the desert. She successfully convinced the order-hating draconequus to join her in destroying the suffocatingly evil order of the Anugypt Empire. Discord was in charge of stealing the golden bone that symbolized the jackals’ ultimate power, diverting the King of Anugypt’s attention, while Baast led her squad directly to the palace. Their cooperation was seamless. The theft, or rather day-light robbery, of the golden bone enraged the King of Anugypt, but it also ignited the spark of rebellion across Anugypt. Soon, cries of support came from every corner of the desert, and a storm that would sweep across all of Anugypt had begun to show its first signs. Even though historical records stop here, later generations can infer that the Anugypt Empire came to an end. Under the leadership of the cats, the Republic era of Anugypt was born.
A millennium later, Discord rarely mentioned his adventure with Baast. Discord merely regarded her as an old friend, but to quote Baast: “I know Discord. And I know he doesn’t have friends.”

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_827]
直到暮光闪闪的时代之前，邪恶的混沌之主无序在历史上从未有过朋友，但却有过那么少数几个值得他铭记的，关系甚于朋友的同伴。这其中的一位生活在古代的安及 — 法老与万民的守护者，安及的革命者，混沌的同行者，共和先驱，巴斯特。
巴斯特成长在一个被暴君统治已久的黑暗时代，在安及帝国的统治下，除豺狼以外的民族统统沦为了黑魔法祭祀仪式的牺牲品。猫猫族受到的压迫最为惨重，他们要为那沙漠之中的死神贡奉粮食以供养豺狼贵族、进献黄金以铸就巨大的骸骨、提供鲜血以唤醒沉睡的亡灵，甚至还要为豺狼族的妄想提供创作艺术的颜料、为豺狼族的虚荣的提供构建金字塔的砖块与劳工。
巴斯特很早就参与了地下抵抗组织，率领着猫猫们与那邪恶的安及之王展开斗争。在一次次的战斗中，巴斯特逐渐成长为一名真正的领导者，也让她结识了一位路过沙漠的龙马。她成功劝说这位厌恶秩序的龙马，与她一同前去破坏安及帝国那邪恶到令人窒息的秩序。龙马无序负责窃取象征豺狼族最高权力的黄金骸骨，转移安及之王的注意力，而巴斯特则率领小队直指皇宫，两者的配合可谓天衣无缝。黄金骸骨失窃（或者说被当面抢劫）彻底激怒了安及之王，但也点燃了安及反抗的星火；很快，沙漠的各个角落都传来响应的呼声，一场席卷整个安及的风暴已经显露出了一角。即使史书的记载到此为止，后世也能够根据历史推断出，安及帝国从此落下了帷幕。在猫猫族领导下，安及的共和时代开启了。
千年之后，无序几乎从未提及他与巴斯特的冒险故事。无序只是将她视作一位老朋友，但引用巴斯特的一句话评价此事：“我了解无序。我知道他从来没有朋友。”
